Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:31.50,Chapter,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}A harbor afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Plan a trip from the information on your screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.84,0:00:09.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Capture the visiting information.\N{\fs25\b0\1c&H8B8686&}Use the capture shortcut assigned in Settings.
